# DME101.030 — Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator
library "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage".

/*
Coverage model for ultrasonic osteogenesis stimulators. `first:` makes the
decision branches ordered (first match wins): the three exclusions are tested
before the approval branch so a denial wins by position, and `otherwise` is the
catch-all disposition. See docs/decision-shapes.md.

The four conditions are modeled as asserted case-features — each `coded from` a
value set and matched against patient facts (see dme101-030.cel). No Has/No
concept pairs: the `first:` ordering + `otherwise` express the negative paths.
*/

// ============ Concepts (case-features) ============

concept "Fracture Of Skull Or Vertebrae":
- type is Condition.
- coded from "Skull Or Vertebrae Fracture VS".

concept "Tumor-Related Fracture":
- type is Condition.
- coded from "Tumor-Related Fracture VS".

concept "Concurrent Noninvasive Stimulator In Use":
- type is Device.
- coded from "Noninvasive Osteogenesis Stimulator VS".

concept "Documented Fracture Nonunion":
- type is Condition.
- coded from "Fracture Nonunion VS".

// ============ Terminology ============

terminology "Skull Or Vertebrae Fracture VS":
- valueset is `http://example.org/dme101/ValueSet/skull-or-vertebrae-fracture-vs`.

terminology "Tumor-Related Fracture VS":
- valueset is `http://example.org/dme101/ValueSet/tumor-related-fracture-vs`.

terminology "Noninvasive Osteogenesis Stimulator VS":
- valueset is `http://example.org/dme101/ValueSet/noninvasive-osteogenesis-stimulator-vs`.

terminology "Fracture Nonunion VS":
- valueset is `http://example.org/dme101/ValueSet/fracture-nonunion-vs`.

// ============ Decision ============

decision "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage":
first:
- when "Fracture Of Skull Or Vertebrae" then recommend activity "Communicate Not Approved".
- when "Tumor-Related Fracture" then recommend activity "Communicate Not Approved".
- when "Concurrent Noninvasive Stimulator In Use" then recommend activity "Communicate Not Approved".
- when "Documented Fracture Nonunion" then recommend activity "Communicate Approved".
- otherwise then recommend activity "Communicate Not Approved".

// ============ Activities ============

activity "Communicate Approved":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Ultrasonic osteogenesis stimulator may be considered medically necessary.`.

activity "Communicate Not Approved":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Ultrasonic osteogenesis stimulator is not medically necessary.`.
